/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Automatic\040ship\040collision\040avoidance\040using\040deep\040reinforcement\040learning\040with\040LSTM\040in\040continuous\040action\040spaces)
/Author (Ryohei\040Sawada\054\040Keiji\040Sato\054\040Takahiro\040Majima)
/Subject (This\040paper\040presents\040an\040automatic\040collision\040avoidance\040algorithm\040for\040ships\040using\040a\040deep\040reinforcement\040learning\040\050DRL\051\040in\040continuous\040action\040spaces\056\040Obstacle\040zone\040by\040target\040\050OZT\051\040is\040used\040to\040compute\040an\040area\040where\040a\040collision\040will\040happen\040in\040the\040future\040based\040on\040dynamic\040information\040of\040ships\056\040Agents\040of\040DRL\040detects\040the\040approach\040of\040multiple\040ships\040using\040a\040virtual\040sensor\040called\040the\040grid\040sensor\056\040Agents\040learned\040collision\040avoidance\040maneuvering\040through\040Imazu\040problem\054\040which\040is\040a\040scenario\040set\040of\040ship\040encounter\040situations\056\040In\040this\040study\054\040we\040propose\040a\040new\040approach\040for\040collision\040avoidance\040with\040a\040longer\040safe\040passing\040distance\040using\040DRL\056\040We\040develop\040a\040novel\040method\040named\040inside\040OZT\040that\040expands\040OZT\040to\040improve\040the\040consistency\040of\040learning\056\040We\040redesign\040the\040network\040using\040the\040long\040short\055term\040memory\040\050LSTM\051\040cell\040and\040carried\040out\040training\040in\040continuous\040action\040spaces\040to\040train\040a\040model\040with\040longer\040safe\040distance\040than\040the\040previous\040study\056\040The\040bow\040cross\040range\040in\040collision\040detection\040proposed\040in\040this\040paper\040is\040effective\040to\040COLREGs\055compliant\040collision\040avoidance\056\040The\040trained\040model\040has\040passed\040all\040scenarios\040of\040Imazu\040problem\056\040The\040model\040is\040also\040validated\040by\040a\040test\040scenario\040which\040includes\040more\040ships\040than\040each\040scenario\040of\040Imazu\040problem\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jun\0402021\054\040Journal\040of\040Marine\040Science\040and\040Technology\054\040Collision\040avoidance\054\040Collision\040detection\054\040Collision\054\040Reinforcement\040learning)
>>
endobj
